    {
      "id": "2104541062136287336",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-09-28T11:57:44.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-09-28 19:57:44",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Today, with over 100 industry partners, we introduced the NVIDIA Open Agent Safety Platform, bringing together OpenShell and Sentry.\n\nArtificial intelligence is extraordinary technology that will advance discovery, productivity, security, health, and prosperity for generations to come.\n\nBut its full promise can only be realized when people have confidence that AI is being built to be safe and deployed with wisdom and responsibility.\n\nThis is bigger than a single product. It's the beginning of an open ecosystem to build the trust layer for safe agent systems.\n\nTogether, we are building the foundation of the AI economy.\n\nTrust and innovation are not in conflict. Safety is how trust is earned. We must build not only the most capable AI, but the most trusted AI, so that this extraordinary technology can realize its enormous promise for the world. https://nvda.ws/4hcoq7m",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
        "author": "JensenHuang",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2080613261674962944/OMXX4RJ3_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-09-28 17:12:26",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-09-28T09:12:26.000Z",
        "id": "2104499465055023424",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTSuRsKaUAE1VGz.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 1080,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTSuRsKaUAE1VGz.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1920
          }
        ],
        "name": "Jensen Huang",
        "text": "Today, with over 100 industry partners, we introduced the NVIDIA Open Agent Safety Platform, bringing together OpenShell and Sentry.\n\nArtificial intelligence is extraordinary technology that will advance discovery, productivity, security, health, and prosperity for generations to come.\n\nBut its full promise can only be realized when people have confidence that AI is being built to be safe and deployed with wisdom and responsibility.\n\nThis is bigger than a single product. It's the beginning of an open ecosystem to build the trust layer for safe agent systems.\n\nTogether, we are building the foundation of the AI economy.\n\nTrust and innovation are not in conflict. Safety is how trust is earned. We must build not only the most capable AI, but the most trusted AI, so that this extraordinary technology can realize its enormous promise for the world. https://nvda.ws/4hcoq7m",
        "url": "https://x.com/JensenHuang/status/2104499465055023424",
